module extern_decl.neg_1

// ONE seeded cause: the `extern "nova" fn` form (D282, plan 91.12 F.-1). The
// parser READS the whole FFI family since 2026-08-20, and since task 131 the
// minimal MEASURED class -- an `extern "C" fn` free function with a C-ABI
// signature -- is COMPILED (the call is emitted by the declaration's literal
// name; see pos_1.nv beside this file). What novac still declines is the
// REST of the family, each by name at the `extern` keyword: this file's
// `extern "nova"` (the registry-spelled runtime symbol is not emitted for a
// program module), `extern "C" unsafe fn` (no unsafe-call door yet, D424), a
// generic extern, one with a body, and a signature type outside the C-ABI
// class (D282 rule 2).
extern "nova" fn rt_ticks() -> u64

fn main() {
    println(1)
}
